        "content": "## USAspending FY2026 software contract activity\nFind up to five federal contract awards matching `software` with activity in US fiscal year 2026, October 1, 2025 through September 30, 2026. Results sort by award amount descending.\n\n1. Select a **Header Auth** credential on the HTTP Request node. Use header name `Authorization` and value `Bearer <your Apify token>`.\n2. Run once. Check the HTTP node for one JSON item per record or download `usaspending-gov-contracts.csv` from **Convert to CSV → Binary → data**. A Google Sheets **Append Row** node can also use the HTTP output.\n\nWith five saved results at the Free plan rate: **$0.02505**. The Actor charge cap is **$0.05** per run. Automatic HTTP retries are off. [Actor pricing](https://apify.com/perceptive_city_af7/usaspending-gov-contracts-scraper/pricing).",
